{"seq":3,"slug":"operation-pattern-graph-cluster","title":"经营画像相似与关联图谱社区发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-multistore-account-linkage-governance/linkage-signal-graph/operation-pattern-graph-cluster","wordCount":2106,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"经营画像相似与关联图谱社区发现\">经营画像相似与关联图谱社区发现</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>有了强信号与弱信号，还差一步：把零散的成对关联聚成「疑似同一控制人」的簇。这一步的必要性来自两方面——治理的处置单位是簇而非边（封禁一个控制人的全部店铺），而单条弱边的可信度又需要靠簇内其他边的存在来校准。本节讲图谱建模、社区发现算法与簇级评分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从信号到图-节点与边的建模\">从信号到图：节点与边的建模</h2><p>关联图谱是一张<strong>异构图</strong>：节点不止店铺一种类型，边也不止一种语义。</p>\n<h3 id=\"节点类型设计\">节点类型设计</h3><p>节点类型包括店铺、法律主体、自然人（责任人/UBO）、设备指纹、支付账户、电话、地址、IP 段。边可以全部抽象成「关联」二值边，但那样会丢失语义，所以更实用的做法是把所有边归一为带权重与类型标签的结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>边类型</th>\n<th>连接</th>\n<th>基础权重来源</th>\n<th>方向性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主体归属</td>\n<td>店铺 — 法律主体</td>\n<td>硬事实（申报/登记）</td>\n<td>有向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>股权控制</td>\n<td>主体 — 自然人</td>\n<td>穿透后累计持股</td>\n<td>有向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>责任绑定</td>\n<td>店铺 — 自然人</td>\n<td>硬事实</td>\n<td>有向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备共现</td>\n<td>店铺 — 设备</td>\n<td>指纹相似度</td>\n<td>无向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金共现</td>\n<td>店铺 — 支付账户</td>\n<td>账户绑定</td>\n<td>无向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络共现</td>\n<td>店铺 — IP 段</td>\n<td>时段共现次数</td>\n<td>无向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>画像相似</td>\n<td>店铺 — 店铺</td>\n<td>多特征相似度</td>\n<td>无向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二分图投影与路径保留\">二分图投影与路径保留</h3><p>一个关键的设计选择是<strong>是否把中间实体（设备、账户）作为节点</strong>，而不是把两家店直接连一条边。把中间实体显式建模的优点是可以区分「两家店共享同一设备」（直接边）与「两家店分别共享不同设备但那些设备也共享同一账户」（通过中间节点形成的间接连通）。后者是更强的证据，而直接建边的做法会把它压缩成弱信号。这是典型的二分图投影问题：店铺—中间实体是二分图，店铺之间的关联是它的投影，投影时应保留路径信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边权重的校准-从似然比到图权重\">边权重的校准：从似然比到图权重</h2><p>边的权重不该是原始的信号计数，而应是对数似然比——这样多条独立边的贡献可以直接相加，等价于联合似然比的乘积。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(e) = \\log \\frac{P(e \\mid H_1)}{P(e \\mid H_0)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"度数惩罚与簇级提升\">度数惩罚与簇级提升</h3><p>具体每个信号的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log LR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 估法见 <a href=\"device-ip-payout-weak-link\">设备/IP/收款弱关联</a> 中的基线频率方法。这里要补充的是<strong>图结构对边权重的反向修正</strong>，它发生在两个层面。</p>\n<p>第一层是<strong>节点度数惩罚</strong>。一个支付账户若绑定了 500 家店铺，它作为关联证据的价值就趋近于零——它可能是一家支付服务商的中转账户。度数惩罚的标准形式是对边权重做一个与端点度数相关的衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>w</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mtext>mid</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w&#x27;(e) = w(e) \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\log(1 + \\deg_{\\text{mid}}(e))}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">de<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mtext>mid</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\deg_{\\text{mid}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">de<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是中间节点（设备、账户、IP）的度数。这个对数衰减对低度数节点几乎无影响，对高度数节点则快速压平。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>簇级提升</strong>。当簇内已确认存在强关联（UBO 或主体归属）时，簇内纯弱边应获得提升——这正是 <a href=\"ubo-company-legal-link\">UBO 强关联</a> 提到的「簇级校准锚点」。实现上是一次两阶段计算：先按强边切出「锚定簇」，再对落在同一锚定簇内的弱边乘以提升因子（如 1.5 倍），最后重新聚类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"社区发现算法的选择\">社区发现算法的选择</h2><p>图上找簇的标准工具是社区发现。最经典的启发式是 Louvain 方法（Blondel 等，2008），它通过最大化模块度（modularity）来提取社区结构，论文声称在计算时间上优于当时已知的其他社区发现方法，并在包含 260 万客户的移动网络与 1.18 亿节点的网页图上做了演示（来源：<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/0803.0476\">Blondel et al., arXiv:0803.0476</a>）。模块度优化的直观含义是：社区内部的连边比随机期望更密集。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模块度的解析度限制\">模块度的解析度限制</h3><p>但直接套用模块度在治理场景有一个致命问题：<strong>模块度对社区规模的解析度有限制</strong>，在存在一个巨大的「正常卖家」连通分量时，小规模的逃逸簇会被吞并或切碎。实践中需要几种针对性的调整：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;全量关联图&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;移除高度数中间节点&lt;br/&gt;(度 &gt; D_max)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;按强边切出锚定簇&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;在锚定簇外运行&lt;br/&gt;加权 Louvain&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E{&quot;簇内最大边权&lt;br/&gt;是否达标?&quot;}&#10;  E -- 否 --&gt; F[&quot;标记为噪声, 不产出候选&quot;]&#10;  E -- 是 --&gt; G[&quot;簇级评分 + 生成候选&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;进入第3章证据分级&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"全量关联图\"] --&gt; B[\"移除高度数中间节点&lt;br/&gt;(度 &gt; D_max)\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"按强边切出锚定簇\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"在锚定簇外运行&lt;br/&gt;加权 Louvain\"]\n  D --&gt; E{\"簇内最大边权&lt;br/&gt;是否达标?\"}\n  E -- 否 --&gt; F[\"标记为噪声, 不产出候选\"]\n  E -- 是 --&gt; G[\"簇级评分 + 生成候选\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"进入第3章证据分级\"]</pre><h3 id=\"显式的剪枝与约束\">显式的剪枝与约束</h3><p>这套流程有三个必要步骤。<strong>高度数节点剪枝</strong>：先把绑定超过阈值的设备、账户、IP 从图中移除（或降权到可忽略），否则它们会把大量无关店铺连成一个巨型分量。<strong>锚定簇优先</strong>：先按强边（主体、UBO）确定不可争辩的簇，再在其外做社区发现，避免强边被弱边稀释。<strong>最小规模与最小密度约束</strong>：产出的簇必须有足够的总权重与内部密度才成为候选，孤立的弱边不成簇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"簇级评分与候选生成\">簇级评分与候选生成</h2><p>社区发现产出的是节点集合，需要转成可裁决的候选对象。簇级评分要回答两个问题：这个簇整体有多可信，以及簇内哪条路径是主要证据链。</p>\n<p>下面给出候选生成的核心数据结构与评分伪代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"CANDIDATE_SCHEMA = {&#10;    &quot;cluster_id&quot;: &quot;str&quot;,&#10;    &quot;member_stores&quot;: [&quot;store_id&quot;],&#10;    &quot;total_weight&quot;: &quot;float&quot;,          # 簇内边权和&#10;    &quot;internal_density&quot;: &quot;float&quot;,      # 实际边数 / 完全图边数&#10;    &quot;strong_edges&quot;: [                 # 参与判定的强边&#10;        {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;same_ubo&quot;, &quot;endpoints&quot;: [&quot;S1&quot;, &quot;S2&quot;], &quot;weight&quot;: 10.8}&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;weak_edge_summary&quot;: {&quot;same_device_fp&quot;: 3, &quot;same_payout&quot;: 1},&#10;    &quot;anchor&quot;: {&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;ubo&quot;, &quot;natural_person_hash&quot;: &quot;...&quot;},&#10;    &quot;evidence_path&quot;: [&quot;S1&quot;, &quot;ACCT-9&quot;, &quot;S2&quot;],  # 最短证据链&#10;    &quot;motivation_hypothesis&quot;: [&quot;ban_evasion&quot;],&#10;    &quot;generated_at&quot;: &quot;ts&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;def score_cluster(c: dict) -&gt; float:&#10;    base = sum(e[&quot;weight&quot;] for e in c[&quot;strong_edges&quot;])&#10;    base += c[&quot;weak_edge_summary_weight&quot;] * ANCHOR_BOOST&#10;    size_penalty = 1.0 if len(c[&quot;member_stores&quot;]) &gt;= 2 else 0.0&#10;    density_factor = min(c[&quot;internal_density&quot;] / 0.4, 1.0)&#10;    return (base * size_penalty * density_factor)&#10;&#10;def emit_candidates(clusters, min_weight=8.0, min_stores=2):&#10;    out = []&#10;    for c in clusters:&#10;        if len(c.member_stores) &lt; min_stores:&#10;            continue&#10;        s = score_cluster(c)&#10;        if s &gt;= min_weight:&#10;            c[&quot;cluster_score&quot;] = s&#10;            out.append(c)&#10;    return sorted(out, key=lambda x: -x[&quot;cluster_score&quot;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CANDIDATE_SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"cluster_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"str\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"member_stores\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"store_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"total_weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"float\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 簇内边权和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"internal_density\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"float\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实际边数 / 完全图边数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"strong_edges\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 参与判定的强边</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"same_ubo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"endpoints\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"weak_edge_summary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"same_device_fp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"same_payout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"anchor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9